    "sections": {
        "description": "Weather Forecast Theme is designed for displaying weather-related information, forecasts,climate updates, and location-based weather details in a clean and organized layout. The theme includes responsive page sections, customizable banners, widget-ready areas, and flexible typography settings for content presentation across devices. It supports image galleries,forecast blocks, blog sections, and navigation menus for structured content management. The layout is optimized for readability and includes options for header customization, footer widgets, and color adjustments through the theme settings panel. Integrated social media icons and newsletter sections help organize communication features without affecting site performance. The theme also supports multiple post formats and a basic SEO-friendly structure for improvedindexing. Lightweight coding practices help maintain loading performance while keeping thedesign simple and functional. It is compatible with standard plugins for contact forms, caching, and galleries, allowing additional functionality when required."
    },
